d everyone with 21. Gordon had 20 for Denver, Jokic added 13, 7 and 5, and Holmgren grabbed 17 boards. Denver scored 16 in the third and OKC pulled away.\n\nBoth teams went 19 of 73 from three. Does a 96-84 grinder tell you anything about the West? \ud83d\udc47 #NBASky"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-10-23T04:32:21.242Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:npwuvhuq3bv4m4mjlkq77cjw/app.bsky.feed.post/3myjdtuurj42w", "cid": "bafyreifwg7pmjqiiahikweflk6jgltbr2s3f5poskn4tnzrzoqdsz23kl4", "author": {"did": "did:plc:npwuvhuq3bv4m4mjlkq77cjw", "handle": "wirereport.bsky.social", "displayName": "Wire Report", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:npwuvhuq3bv4m4mjlkq77cjw/bafkreidftz4r4y445zs43ymbbo7e6h3hql52dmdmz37uuf5zygzcmuky2m", "associated": {"activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2026-06-04T04:16:48.768Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-10-23T04:31:18.668289Z", "embed": {"$type": "app.bsky.embed.images", "images": [{"alt": "FINAL: Denver Nuggets 84, Oklahoma City Thunder 96", "image": {"$type": "blob", "ref": {"$link": "bafkreicnu3hfdk7w62hpfzjdpadt7ioljs3hhae4t566nb6b6qhzv26aja"}, "mimeType": "image/png", "size": 106662}}]}, "text": "FINAL: Denver Nuggets 84, Oklahoma City Thunder 96\n\n\ud83c\udfc0 Chet Holmgren: 12 PTS, 17 REB, 2 AST, 1 STL, 4 BLK\n\ud83c\udfc0 Ajay Mitchell: 12 PTS, 5 STL, 1 BLK\n\nTrailing by 4 at halftime, the Oklahoma City Thunder outscored the Denver Nuggets 26-16 in the third quarter to win by 12."}, "embed": {"images": [{"thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:npwuvhuq3bv4m4mjlkq77cjw/bafkreicnu3hfdk7w62hpfzjdpadt7ioljs3hhae4t566nb6b6qhzv26aja", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:npwuvhuq3bv4m4mjlkq77cjw/bafkreicnu3hfdk7w62hpfzjdpadt7ioljs3hhae4t566nb6b6qhzv26aja", "alt": "FINAL: Denver Nuggets 84, Oklahoma Cit